        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Lens and Look\n\n**Lens and Look** pairs optical controls (focal length, aperture, film stock) with a directed camera move.\n\n1. **Subject**, **Focal Length**, **Aperture**, and **Film Look** compose the optical brief for **TextToImage**.\n2. The rendered keyframe passes directly into **ImageToVideo** along with your chosen **Camera Move**."
